    {
        "content": "<p>It seems bad to be in a situation where this would help</p>",
        "id": 583430186,
        "sender_full_name": "Ruben Van de Velde",
        "timestamp": 1775210850
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>This comes up for me when using a Finset where i later need to have a set because i need to apply an operation that will return a set (which might not be finite) later</p>",
        "id": 583430977,
        "sender_full_name": "Moritz Roos",
        "timestamp": 1775211262
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>more precisely i have something along the lines of:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">liminf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Seq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">F</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Seq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Seq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>and i want to reason about </p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">liminf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Ns</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Y</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toFinset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">)))</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 583431869,
        "sender_full_name": "Moritz Roos",
        "timestamp": 1775211756
    },
    {
